pluginstrument.description:
Engine Gauge Set your prefered EGT scale in the code, it's very easy!
An instrument fitted the Baron B58 instrument set. EGT varies from sim and from aircraft to aircraft. You might need to adjust the scale to make it suit your needs.
@screen size 1440 x 900 for a full screen panel, the geometry can be set to: (x, y, w, h) 1280, 480, 160, 160
